<title>UK: DSL Bank sets 2.0 billion Lux franc 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>DSL Bank sets 2.0 billion Lux franc 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following step-up bond was announced by lead manager Credit Europeen-BBL.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DSL BANK</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     *5.0	MATURITY    19.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.75    PAY DATE 18/19.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 YIELD	5.45 PCT  PRAECIPUUM  0.25</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR FIRST FOUR YEARS, 6.0 PCT FOR THREE YEARS AND</p>
<p>		 7.125 PCT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
